              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kho 13:30–32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wasesithi: Myekeleni, amathambo akhe angasuswa muntu. Basebewayekela amathambo akhe kanye lamathambo omprofethi owavela eSamariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJosiya wasusa amathempeli ezindawo eziphakemeyo zokukhonzela ezisemizini yaseSamariya ayakhiwe ngamakhosi akoIsrayeli ethukuthelisa iNkosi, wenza kiwo lokho akwenza eBetheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabulalela abapristi bezindawo eziphakemeyo zokukhonzela phezu kwama‐altare, watshisela amathambo abantu phezu kwawo. Wasebuyela eJerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi uJosiya yalaya bonke abantu yathi: Ligcine iPhasika leNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu, njengalokhu kulotshiwe kulincwadi yesivumelwano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lalingagcinwanga iPhasika elinjalo kusukela ensukwini zabehluleli abaphatha uIsrayeli, lakuzo zonke insuku zamakhosi akoIsrayeli lezamakhosi akoJuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa ngomnyaka wetshumi lesificaminwembili wokubusa kukaJosiya lagcinwa iPhasika leNkosi eJerusalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJosiya wasusa abalamadlozi, labathakathi, lezithombe ezithiwa amaterafi, lezinye izithombe, lawo wonke amanyala okwakukhona elizweni lakoJuda laseJerusalema, ukuze aqinise amazwi omlayo ayelotshwe encwadini uHilikiya umpristi ayifumana ethempelini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngaphambi kwakhe kakubanga khona inkosi eyafanana laye eyaphendukela eNkosini uNkulunkulu ngenhliziyo yayo yonke langomoya wayo wonke langamandla ayo wonke, yalandela wonke umlayo kaMose. Futhi kakuvelanga enye inkosi ngemva kwakhe eyafanana laye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanti iNkosi kayidedanga ekuvutheni kolaka lwayo olwavutha kakhulu koJuda ngenxa yazo zonke izinto uManase ayithukuthelisa ngazo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi: Ngizamsusa loJuda phambi kwami njengoIsrayeli engamsusayo, ngiwulahle lumuzi waseJerusalema engawukhethayo, lendlu engathembisa ukuba ibizo lami lizakuba kuyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezinye indaba zikaJosiya lakho konke akwenzayo kulotshiwe ogwalweni lwezindaba zamakhosi akoJuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensukwini zokubusa kukaJosiya uFaro‐Neko inkosi yaseGibithe wasuka waya enkosini yaseAsiriya ngasemfuleni iYufrathi. UJosiya wahlangabezana laye; ekuhlanganeni kwabo uFaro‐Neko wambulala eMegido. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inceku zakhe zathwala isidumbu sakhe ngenqola, zisisusa eMegido zasisa eJerusalema, zamgcwaba elibeni lakhe. Abantu belizwe basebethatha uJehowahazi indodana kaJosiya, bamgcoba, bambeka waba yinkosi esikhundleni sikayise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehowahazi wayeleminyaka engamatshumi amabili lantathu lapho eqalisa ukubusa; wabusa inyanga ezintathu eJerusalema. Ibizo likanina lalinguHamutali indodakazi kaJeremiya waseLibina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenza okubi phambi kweNkosi njengokwenza konke kwabokhokho bakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UFaro‐Neko wambopha eRibila elizweni laseHamathi ukuba angabe esabusa eJerusalema, wathelisa ilizwe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " esiliva alikhulu lethalenta elilodwa legolide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UFaro‐Neko wabeka uEliyakimi indodana kaJosiya ukuba abe yinkosi esikhundleni sikayise, waliphendula ibizo lakhe wathi nguJehoyakimi. Wathatha uJehowahazi, wamusa eGibithe lapho afela khona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.22.11+JER.22.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 22:11–12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehoyakimi wamnika uFaro isiliva legolide, wathelisa ilizwe ukuze azuze leyomali ebizwa nguFaro. Wathelisa abantu, wabathelisa bonke ngamandla abo ukuze azuze imali yokunika uFaro‐Neko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
